.TH EGGHEAD-LLM 1 "April 2026" "egghead 0.1.0" "Egghead Manual"
.SH NAME
egghead-llm \- manage LLM providers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B egghead llm
.RI [ subcommand ]
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR PATH ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage LLM provider configuration. Egghead supports multiple providers
simultaneously. Each provider needs an API key and gives access to its
models. Supported providers: Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, and
OpenAI-compatible APIs.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B list
Show configured providers and key status. This is the default when no
subcommand is given.
.TP
.B add
Add a provider interactively.
.TP
.B remove \fIname\fR
Remove a provider by name.
.TP
.B test
Verify all configured providers can connect.
.TP
.B models
List all available models with context window sizes.
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-config \fIPATH\fR
Override config file location.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help text.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Provider config lives in
.I ~/.config/egghead/config.yml
under
.BR llm: .
API keys can reference environment variables:
.PP
.nf
llm:
  \- provider: anthropic
    api_key: "{env:ANTHROPIC_API_KEY}"
.fi
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
egghead llm
egghead llm add
egghead llm models
egghead llm remove openai
egghead llm test
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR egghead-init (1),
.BR egghead-config (1),
.BR egghead-doctor (1),
.BR egghead (1)
